---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
const guides = (await getCollection("blog")).filter((post) => !post.data.draft && post.data.category === "Rent").sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.getTime() - a.data.pubDate.getTime()).slice(0, 4);
---
<BaseLayout title="Renting in Ontario | Dongho Lee Real Estate" description="Practical Ontario rental guidance for tenants and landlords—from planning and documents to a clearer next step.">
  <section class="services-hero"><p class="page-kicker">Rent a Home</p><h1>Rent with a Clear Plan</h1><p class="lead">Whether you are finding a home, reviewing a lease, planning a move or managing a rental property, we turn Ontario rental questions into practical next steps. Your timing, budget, documents and responsibilities stay connected from the start.</p><p class="lead ko">집을 찾는 단계부터 계약서 검토, 입주·퇴거, 임대 관리까지 온타리오 렌트 과정의 질문을 현실적인 다음 단계로 정리합니다. 일정, 예산, 서류와 책임을 처음부터 함께 살펴봅니다.</p><div class="hero-actions journey-hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=rent_consultation">무료 렌트 상담 신청하기</a><a class="button secondary" href="tel:14166258241">Call · 전화 416-625-8241</a></div></section>
  <section class="conversion-panel" aria-label="How Dongho helps with Ontario rentals"><div class="conversion-copy"><p class="page-kicker">Start Here</p><h2>A rental decision is more than finding an available home.</h2><p>We begin with your situation, budget, location and timing. From there, you can understand the documents, Ontario rules and practical choices that matter before you sign, move or make a change.</p></div><div class="conversion-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=rent_consultation">무료 렌트 상담 신청하기</a><span>한국어 · English 상담 가능</span></div></section>
  <section class="services-grid journey-steps" aria-label="Rental support">
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">01</div><h2>Plan <span>렌트 준비</span></h2><h3>Budget, timing and priorities</h3><p>예산, 희망 지역, 입주 일정과 생활 조건을 정리해 가능한 선택지를 현실적으로 좁힙니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">02</div><h2>Search <span>집 찾기</span></h2><h3>A focused rental search</h3><p>지역, 매물 조건과 필요한 서류를 비교해 본인 상황에 맞는 렌트 선택을 돕습니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">03</div><h2>Review <span>계약 검토</span></h2><h3>Lease terms and Ontario rules</h3><p>계약 조건, 보증금, N-forms와 주요 절차를 이해하기 쉽게 검토해 서명 전 확인할 사항을 정리합니다.</p></article>
    <article class="service-card"><div class="service-icon">04</div><h2>Move <span>다음 단계</span></h2><h3>Move-in, changes and next steps</h3><p>입주·퇴거, 서브렛 또는 Assignment처럼 상황이 바뀔 때 필요한 선택지와 다음 단계를 안내합니다.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="featured-guides" aria-label="Rental guides"><div class="home-section-heading"><div><p class="page-kicker">Related Guides</p><h2>Rental Guides</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/category/rent/">모든 렌트 가이드 보기</a></div><div class="home-posts">{guides.map((post) => <article class="post-card"><h2><a href={`/${post.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h2><p>{post.data.description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="services-cta"><div><p class="page-kicker">Next Step</p><h2>Need a clearer rental plan?<small>렌트 계획을 더 명확하게 정리하고 싶으신가요?</small></h2><p>Tell us your situation, timing and priorities. We will help you identify the most useful next step.</p><p class="ko-copy">현재 상황과 일정, 우선순위를 알려주시면 지금 가장 필요한 다음 단계를 함께 정리해 드립니다.</p><a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=rent_consultation">렌트 상담 시작하기</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
